      "text": "Your team moves fast."
    },
    {
      "start": 1.6,
      "end": 3.95,
      "text": "Your product context should keep up."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.35,
      "end": 6.25,
      "text": "Requirements live in documents."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.25,
      "end": 8.2,
      "text": "Changes arrive in conversations."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.2,
      "end": 12.7,
      "text": "Your coding agent starts with whatever context someone remembered to paste."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.1,
      "end": 16.75,
      "text": "Orchestra connects the evidence, the decisions, and the work."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.15,
      "end": 18.55,
      "text": "Start with a source."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.55,
      "end": 23.125,
      "text": "Ask Socrates a product question, then open the citation behind its answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.525,
      "end": 27.15,
      "text": "In our Northstar project, CSV export is documented."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.15,
      "end": 29.65,
      "text": "PDF export is a request."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.65,
      "end": 31.25,
      "text": "Those are different things."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.65,
      "end": 34.55,
      "text": "Truth Inbox brings proposed changes into review."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.55,
      "end": 37.6,
      "text": "Authorised decisions shape the Product Brain."
    },
    {
      "start": 38,
      "end": 42.2,
      "text": "Agent Preflight gives your coding agent a scoped context pack."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.2,
      "end": 45.25,
      "text": "Postflight links reported work back to that starting point."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.65,
      "end": 47.55,
      "text": "Keep the reason behind the requirement."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.55,
      "end": 52.025,
      "text": "Give the next person, and the next agent, a clearer place to begin."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.695,
      "end": 53.7,
      "text": "Orchestra."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.7,
      "end": 55.82,
      "text": "Product Brain for High Speed Teams."
